      "text": "Added Ultrafast mode for GPT-6 Astra in the Responses API. Use gpt-6-astra with service_tier: \"ultrafast\" to reduce the time between generated output tokens. It is available to API customers, subject to rate limits, with global processing and US data residency. EU and other regional inference reside",
